 "stem": "On the same square net, the functions $f(x)={=a}x {=bs}$ and $g(x)={=c}$ (a constant function), both from $\\mathbb{R}$ to $\\mathbb{R}$, are represented graphically. Find the coordinates of the point where the two lines meet. Write your answer as (x, y).",
 "answer": "",
